    "Is the service duration of 90 minutes the time the truck spends at the customer location (i.e., the truck is occupied and cannot travel during those 90 minutes), or is it something else?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response contains a single clarification question asking for the definition of the 90-minute service duration."
}

